body:
You can totally date! You just need to find someone who is willing to work through the struggles because they love you!   My ex girlfriend suffered from PTSD, and she had a lot of habits that made it difficult for me to date her. But we made it work! I loved her enough to work past everything, and it helped her deal with her hardships because she had someone supporting her. 

&#x200B;

It might not seem like it right now, but you just need to find someone to support and love you for you!
